<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's foreign exchange market is closed on Saturday for national holiday. It will reopen on Monday.</p>
<p>On Friday, the Taiwan dollar ended at T$27.549 against the U.S. dollar, compared with Thursday's T$27.540 close.</p>
<p>-- James Peng (5080815)</p>
</text>
